  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Codabar from PowerPoint is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Codabar barcode from PowerPoint in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode Codabar data message from PowerPoint file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
